  "Most servers let you make a password that only works for one app — use one of those here rather than the password to your whole account. It is stored on this device and is the one thing a backup file never carries.": "Aksariyat serverlar faqat bitta ilova uchun ishlaydigan parol yaratishga imkon beradi — bu yerda butun hisobingiz paroli oʻrniga shundayidan foydalaning. U shu qurilmada saqlanadi va zaxira nusxa fayli hech qachon olib yurmaydigan yagona narsa.",
