  "Normal speed": "Odatiy tezlik",
  "Not now": "Hozir emas",
  "Not synced yet. Press Sync now, or wait — Ventic syncs on its own every few minutes and whenever a film ends.": "Hali sinxronlanmagan. «Hozir sinxronlash» tugmasini bosing yoki kuting — Ventic bir necha daqiqada bir va har safar kino tugaganda oʻzi sinxronlaydi.",
  "Nothing answered. On the other device, switch on Settings → Network → “Let other devices play films on this one”, then search again — or type its address below.": "Hech narsa javob bermadi. Boshqa qurilmada Sozlamalar → Tarmoq → «Boshqa qurilmalarga bunda kino ijro etishga ruxsat berish» ni yoqing, soʻng qayta qidiring — yoki quyida uning manzilini yozing.",
  "Nothing arrived from the swarm. This release has no seeders that will talk to this device — try a different one.": "Toʻdadan hech narsa kelmadi. Bu nashrda shu qurilma bilan gaplashadigan seeder yoʻq — boshqasini sinab koʻring.",
  "Nothing certain in the last twenty minutes — listening to the whole film…": "Soʻnggi yigirma daqiqada aniq hech narsa yoʻq — butun film tinglanmoqda…",
  "Nothing chosen yet, so the background is a flat colour for now.": "Hali hech narsa tanlanmagan, shuning uchun fon hozircha bir xil rangda.",
  "Nothing downloading.": "Hech narsa yuklab olinmayapti.",
  "Nothing here.": "Bu yerda hech narsa yoʻq.",
  "Nothing matches.": "Hech narsa mos kelmadi.",
  "Nothing on this device can open that file. HEVC/x265 and AV1 depend on the hardware decoder, and older boxes have neither — try a 1080p x264 release.": "Bu qurilmada u faylni ochadigan hech narsa yoʻq. HEVC/x265 va AV1 apparat dekoderiga bogʻliq, eski qutilarda esa ikkalasi ham yoʻq — 1080p x264 relizini sinab koʻring.",
  "Nothing to play": "Ijro etadigan narsa yoʻq",
  "Off": "Oʻchiq",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "Oʻchirilganda oʻz foningiz bunga aralashmaydi: rasm ekranda turganda mavzu oʻz ranglarini saqlaydi va faqat sarlavha grafikasi uni yopgandagina oʻzgaradi.",
  "On the air": "Efirda",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "Yoqilganda fon siz koʻrsatayotgan yoki tanlagan kartaga ergashadi. Oʻchirilganda esa faqat siz haqiqatan biror narsani ochganingizda oʻzgaradi — uzun roʻyxatda barqarorroq, aks holda bir qator boʻylab yurishning oʻzi butun oynani karta-karta qayta chizadi.",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "Yoqilganda ilova sizning rasmingiz ustida turadi va siz film yoki serial sahifasida boʻlganingizda grafika uni yopadi. Oʻchirilganda rasm joyida qoladi va uni hech qachon hech narsa yopmaydi.",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "Bitta rang, qolgan palitrani esa Materialning oʻz generatori shundan hisoblab chiqadi.",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "Bu mavsumdagi bitta oldingi qism hali koʻrilmagan.",
  "One earlier season is still unwatched.": "Bitta oldingi mavsum hali koʻrilmagan.",
  "One-off or monthly, from any card or PayPal. Ko-fi takes no cut of it.": "Bir marta yoki har oy, istalgan karta bilan yoki PayPal orqali. Ko-fi bundan ulush olmaydi.",
