  "{drive} is formatted FAT32, which can't hold a single file over {limit}. Bigger releases are dimmed in the source list and are never picked automatically — everything smaller works normally.": "{drive} FAT32da formatlangan, u {limit} dan katta birorta faylni sigʻdira olmaydi. Kattaroq relizlar manbalar roʻyxatida xiralashgan koʻrinadi va hech qachon avtomatik tanlanmaydi — undan kichigi hammasi odatdagidek ishlaydi.",
  "{drive} is plugged in, but nothing can be written to it — this device doesn't support the format the drive is in. Formatting it here fixes that, and erases whatever is on the drive.": "{drive} ulangan, lekin unga hech narsa yozib boʻlmaydi — bu qurilma diskdagi formatni qoʻllab-quvvatlamaydi. Uni shu yerda formatlash buni hal qiladi va diskdagi hamma narsani oʻchirib yuboradi.",
